  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Second Higher Education Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Objectives of the Project are (a) enhanced quality, efficiency and relevance of higher education through a set of systemic reforms, and incentives to selected institutions; and (b) improved access for academically qualified students from disadvantaged groups in (i) higher education and (ii) higher secondary education.</narrative>
  </description>
